---
// About.astro - Sección Quiénes Somos y Pilares Institucionales
---

<section id="quienes-somos" class="w-full py-12 md:py-16 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-7xl mx-auto reveal-on-scroll">
  <div
    class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-10 md:p-12 border border-neutral-border/40 shadow-sm"
    style="background-image: radial-gradient(circle at 95% 10%, rgba(246, 199, 183, 0.22) 0%, transparent 35%), radial-gradient(circle at 5% 90%, rgba(246, 166, 35, 0.12) 0%, transparent 35%), url('data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg width=\'24\' height=\'24\' viewBox=\'0 0 24 24\' xmlns=\'http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\'%3E%3Cpath d=\'M0 0h24v24H0z\' fill=\'none\'/%3E%3Cpath d=\'M1 1h1v1H1zm12 12h1v1h-1z\' fill=\'%23C8BBAA\' fill-opacity=\'0.08\'/%3E%3C/svg%3E'); box-shadow: 0 4px 20px -2px rgba(110, 31, 28, 0.04);"
  >
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between gap-6 mb-10 pb-8 border-b border-neutral-border/30">
      <div class="max-w-xl">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-soft-chip text-primary-dark font-bold text-xs mb-3 border border-neutral-border/30">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[15px]">info</span>
          <span>Conoce nuestra labor</span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-primary-dark tracking-tight leading-tight">
          Quiénes somos
        </h2>
      </div>
      <p class="text-base text-text-main/80 max-w-md leading-relaxed">
        Dame Tu Pata es una iniciativa salvadoreña dedicada al rescate, cuidado y reubicación responsable de perritos en necesidad.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
      <!-- 1. Historia -->
      <div class="bg-[#F2EDE3]/70 rounded-2xl p-7 border border-neutral-border/30 flex flex-col justify-between hover:bg-[#F2EDE3] hover:shadow-md transition-all reveal-on-scroll stagger-1">
        <div class="flex-1">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-soft-chip flex items-center justify-center text-primary-dark mb-5 shadow-sm">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[26px]">history_edu</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-primary-dark mb-2.5">Historia</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-text-main/75 leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Contenido institucional en proceso de validación oficial por Dame Tu Pata.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="pt-4 border-t border-neutral-border/30 flex items-center gap-2 text-text-main/60 text-xs font-medium mt-auto">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">schedule</span>
          <span>En preparación</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 2. Misión -->
      <div class="bg-[#F2EDE3]/70 rounded-2xl p-7 border border-neutral-border/30 flex flex-col justify-between hover:bg-[#F2EDE3] hover:shadow-md transition-all reveal-on-scroll stagger-2">
        <div class="flex-1">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-soft-chip flex items-center justify-center text-primary-dark mb-5 shadow-sm">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[26px]">flag</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-primary-dark mb-2.5">Misión</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-text-main/75 leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Contenido institucional en proceso de validación oficial por Dame Tu Pata.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="pt-4 border-t border-neutral-border/30 flex items-center gap-2 text-text-main/60 text-xs font-medium mt-auto">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">schedule</span>
          <span>En preparación</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 3. Visión -->
      <div class="bg-[#F2EDE3]/70 rounded-2xl p-7 border border-neutral-border/30 flex flex-col justify-between hover:bg-[#F2EDE3] hover:shadow-md transition-all reveal-on-scroll stagger-3">
        <div class="flex-1">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-soft-chip flex items-center justify-center text-primary-dark mb-5 shadow-sm">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[26px]">visibility</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-primary-dark mb-2.5">Visión</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-text-main/75 leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Contenido institucional en proceso de validación oficial por Dame Tu Pata.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="pt-4 border-t border-neutral-border/30 flex items-center gap-2 text-text-main/60 text-xs font-medium mt-auto">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">schedule</span>
          <span>En preparación</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 4. Cobertura -->
      <div class="bg-[#F2EDE3]/70 rounded-2xl p-7 border border-neutral-border/30 flex flex-col justify-between hover:bg-[#F2EDE3] hover:shadow-md transition-all reveal-on-scroll stagger-4">
        <div class="flex-1">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-soft-chip flex items-center justify-center text-primary-dark mb-5 shadow-sm">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[26px]">map</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-primary-dark mb-2.5">Labor y Cobertura</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-text-main/75 leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Contenido institucional en proceso de validación oficial por Dame Tu Pata.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="pt-4 border-t border-neutral-border/30 flex items-center gap-2 text-text-main/60 text-xs font-medium mt-auto">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">schedule</span>
          <span>En preparación</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
